<h3>Column variations · composable <code>--no-*</code> toggles</h3>
<p><code>--no-prev</code>, <code>--no-delta</code>, and <code>--no-target</code> compose. <code>metric</code> and <code>now</code> are mandatory; any combination of the other three can be dropped to land on a 2-, 3-, or 4-column shape. Templates and cell-hiding rules are precomputed in the framework, so consumers just toggle the modifier classes.</p>

